       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day, so this is double that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks at this level:** GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. The risk is higher even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nWas this meant to be one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily (3,200 mg/day).** This is the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions, and it's often used short-term.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily.** This is the typical analgesic range.\n- **1600 mg per day in divided doses.** For example, 400 mg 4 times daily, or 800 mg twice daily.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If 1600 mg four times daily is what you intend, tell me the indication and I'll note it on the order. I'd still suggest checking it with pharmacy first."
